        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-700.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-700-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH701-SYSTOLIC-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH702-MATRIX-MULT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH703-PE-LAT-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH704-705M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH705-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-700-WIT      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-700.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-700.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH701-SYSTOLIC-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH702-MATRIX-MULT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH703-PE-LAT-OK = 1 AND
